00:50:09.205 --> 00:50:14.104
Manny Azizi: Yeah, so this is the bath that the muscle tendon unit is sitting.


287
00:50:14.105 --> 00:50:14.555
Victoria Wood: sitting in.


288
00:50:14.555 --> 00:50:30.564
Manny Azizi: is literally at that temperature. So our model is agnostic to the temperature, but our muscle tendon unit is being affected by varying the temperature of the system. So we're really varying the muscle dynamics directly here.


