00:50:52.345 --> 00:51:08.255
Manny Azizi: very sick… I mean, these are ectothermic animals, so they're not… so they're at the will of their environment. However, I will give this nice anecdote, which is that, when we went to the Calaveras County frog jumping competition.


293
00:51:08.385 --> 00:51:12.015
Victoria Wood: That sounds fun. All of the best competitors.


