00:52:39.825 --> 00:52:56.175
Manny Azizi: effectively adding a, … you're adding a spring in series, an additional spring in series, effectively, by having them jump off a diving board effectively. And what's interesting is, I don't think they're consciously doing this.


310
00:52:56.195 --> 00:53:00.614
Manny Azizi: But they… their behavior slows down because they're, ….


